{"version":1,"content":"<p>今年以來，科技板塊的資本持續流入，疊加AI投資與普及提振的經濟增長預期，正為美元提供堅實支撐。<strong>而與此同時，德意志銀行基於國際貿易中心(ITC)數據的分析顯示，在席捲全球的人工智能熱潮助推下，半導體的全球出口總額已首次超越石油與天然氣。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588170.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:37:49.352802+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:20:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:11.412630+00:00","content_hash":"4c0d8333733fa37ad20f02b0412f647f32a3da27356194fcab180f713edfecd5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}